:: School Lockers [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<schooleffects>><<effects>><<set $lock to 0>>
<<if $loglocations is 1>><<log "Was at the school lockers." $locationimportance>><</if>>

The school lockers are notoriously easy to break into.
<br><br>
<<if $lockeralarm gte 7>>
There's a notice asking students to keep an eye out for and report locker thieves.
<<elseif $lockeralarm gte 4>>
There's a notice recommending not leaving valuables in the lockers posted nearby.
<</if>>

<<if $schoolstate isnot "early" and $schoolstate isnot "late" and $schoolstate isnot "earlynoschool" and $schoolstate isnot "latenoschool" and $schoolstate isnot "daynoschool">>

	<<if $skulduggery gte $lock>>
	<span class="green">The lock looks easy to pick.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Break into them (0:30)|School Lockers Sneak]]>><<pass 30>><<crimeup 30>><</link>><<crime>>
	<br>
	<<else>>
	<span class="red">The lock looks beyond your ability to pick.</span><<skulduggeryrequired>>
	<br><br>
	<</if>>

<<else>>
During school there may be valuables left inside them.
<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Leave (0:01)|Hallways]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $debug is 1>>
	<br>
	__Debug__
	<br>
	Money in lockers: $lockermoney
	<br>
	Money stolen from lockers: $lockertheft
	<br>
	Locker theft wariness: $lockeralarm
	<br>
<</if>>

:: School Lockers Sneak [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

<<if $rng gte 81 and $lockermoney gte 6>>

You successfully pick the locks.

<<if $skulduggery lt 100>>
<<skulduggeryskilluse>><<set $skulduggery += 5>>
<<else>>
<span class="blue">There's nothing more you can learn from locks this simple.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

You find £6 worth of coins scattered around. Probably meant for bus fare.
<br><br>

<<link [[Take it|School Lockers]]>><<set $money += 600>><<set $lockermoney -= 6>><<set $lockertheft += 6>><<crimeup 1>><<log "Broke into a locker at school and found some coins." 2>><</link>><<crime>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|School Lockers]]>><<log "Broke into a locker at school and found some coins but didn't take them." 2>><</link>>
<br>

<<elseif $rng gte 61+$lockeralarm>>

You successfully pick the locks.

<<if $skulduggery lt 100>>
<<skulduggeryskilluse>><<set $skulduggery += 5>>
<<else>>
<span class="blue">There's nothing more you can learn from locks this simple.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

There's nothing of interest inside the lockers. Just some pens and pencils strewn around.
<br><br>

<<link [[Leave|School Lockers]]>><<log "Broke into a locker at school but found nothing of interest." 1>><</link>>
<br>

<<elseif $rng gte 60>><!-- 1 + $lockeralarm % chance -->

You successfully pick the locks.

<<if $skulduggery lt 100>>
<<skulduggeryskilluse>><<set $skulduggery += 5>>
<<else>>
<span class="blue">There's nothing more you can learn from locks this simple.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $rng % 2 is 1>>
	You begin to search the locker for anything worthwhile when suddenly you're pushed into the locker. The locker slams shut and you hear the lock click. "Since you love my locker so much feel free to stay in it." They leave you trapped there.
	<<endevent>>
	<!-- -->
	<<link [[Make noise|School Lockers Life]]>><<set $phase to "noise">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Wait|School Lockers Life]]>><<set $phase to "wait">><</link>>
<<else>>
	You begin to search the locker for anything worthwhile when suddenly you're pushed into the locker. The locker slams shut and you hear the lock click. "Since you love lockers so much feel free to stay in one." They leave you trapped there.
	<<endevent>>
	<br><br>
	Half an hour passes before a <<generatey1>><<person1>><<person>> unwittingly frees you, jumping back in shock as you step out. <<covered>>
	<<pass 30>>
	<<if $submissive gte 1150>>
		You scurry past <<him>> without looking.
	<<elseif $submissive lte 850>>
		"Took long enough," you say, leaving them dumbstruck.
	<<else>>
		"Thanks," you say as you hurry past them, leaving them dumbstruck.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<set $logprep to "TBD Stuck in locker">>
	<<log $logprep 3>>
	<<logopinion "That was interesting">>
	<<link [[Next|School Lockers]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>



<<elseif $rng gte 41 and $lockermoney gte 30>>

You successfully pick the locks.

<<if $skulduggery lt 100>>
<<skulduggeryskilluse>><<set $skulduggery += 5>>
<<else>>
<span class="blue">There's nothing more you can learn from locks this simple.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

A bit of rummaging uncovers £30.
<br><br>

<<if $lockeralarm lt 5 or $rng % 4 isnot 1>>
	<<link [[Take it|School Lockers]]>><<set $money += 3000>><<set $lockermoney -= 30>><<set $lockertheft += 30>><<crimeup 5>><<log "Broke into a locker at school and found some money" 2>><</link>><<crime>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Take it|School Lockers Trap]]>><<set $money += 3000>><<set $lockermoney -= 30>><<set $lockertheft += 30>><<crimeup 5>><</link>><<crime>>
<</if>>
<<link [[Leave|School Lockers]]>><<log "Broke into a locker at school and found some money but didn't take it." 2>><</link>>
<br>

<<elseif $rng gte 21>>

You successfully pick the locks.

<<if $skulduggery lt 100>>
<<skulduggeryskilluse>><<set $skulduggery += 5>>
<<else>>
<span class="blue">There's nothing more you can learn from locks this simple.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

You rummage through the belongings, but find nothing of value.
<br><br>

<<link [[Leave|School Lockers]]>><<log "Broke into a locker at school but found nothing of interest." 1>><</link>>
<br>

<<else>>

You successfully pick the locks.

<<if $skulduggery lt 100>>
<<skulduggeryskilluse>><<set $skulduggery += 5>>
<<else>>
<span class="blue">There's nothing more you can learn from locks this simple.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $schoolstate isnot "early" and $schoolstate isnot "late" and $schoolstate isnot "earlynoschool" and $schoolstate isnot "latenoschool" and $schoolstate isnot "daynoschool">>
	<<generatey1>>You are rummaging through some belongings when you hear a voice behind you. "Hey, that's my locker!" The voice belongs to a <<person1>><<personcomma>> who looks angry at your intrusion.
  <br><br>

	<<link [[Apologise|School Lockers Apology]]>><</link>><<lcool>>
  <br>
	<<link [[Lie|School Lockers Lie]]>><</link>><<gdelinquency>>
  <br>
	<<link [[Fight|School Lockers Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
  <br>

<<else>>
	There's nothing of interest inside the lockers. Just some pens and pencils strewn around.
  <br><br>

	<<link [[Leave|School Lockers]]>><<log "Broke into a locker at school but found nothing of interest." 1>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>

<</if>>

:: School Lockers Apology [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

You look down at your feet in shame. "S-sorry. I just wanted a look."
<br><br>

<<if $rng gte 95>><<status -5>>
	The <<person>> looks mollified. "You really shouldn't do that, I thought you were trying to steal from me." <<he>> says, looking through <<his>> belongings. Probably checking if anything is missing.
  <br><br>
	<<log "Broke into a locker at school and was found out but just saying sorry was enough to get the person to forgive me." 2>>
	<<link [[Next|School Lockers]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
  <br>
<<elseif $rng gte 5+$lockeralarm*2>>/* 5-25% fail chance*/<<status -10>>
	The <<person>> is not impressed, but doesn't seem as angry. "Just piss off," <<he>> says, looking through <<his>> belongings. Probably checking if anything is missing.
  <br><br>
	<<log "Broke into a locker at school and was found out but just saying sorry was enough to get the person to leave me alone." 2>>
	<<link [[Next|School Lockers]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
  <br>
<<else>><<status -10>>
	The <<person>> seems to just get angrier. "Like hell you did, nobody steals from me!" <<he>> yells, and attacks you.
  <br><br>
	<<link [[Next|School Lockers Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>

:: School Lockers Lie [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

You feign confusion. "Your locker? I thought this was mine. Silly me."
<br><br>

<<if $rng gte 95>>
	The <<person>> is not impressed, but doesn't seem as angry. "Well, it's not, so piss off." <<he>> says, looking through <<his>> belongings. Probably checking if anything is missing.
  <br><br>
	<<set $logprep to "Broke into a locker at school and was found out but luckily "+$he+" bought my excuse of thinking that it was my locker.">>
	<<log $logprep 2>>
	<<link [[Next|School Lockers]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
  <br>
<<elseif $rng gte 5+$lockeralarm*3>><<detention 3 "Theft">>
	"Your locker is nowhere near here, I'm not stupid," <<he>> says, looking through <<his>> belongings. Probably checking if anything is missing.
  <br><br>
	<<set $logprep to "Broke into a locker at school and was found out but despite "+$him+" not buying my excuse "+$he+" left me alone.">>
	<<log $logprep 2>>
	<<link [[Next|School Lockers]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
  <br>
<<else>>
	The <<person>> seems to just get angrier. "That's a blatant lie, your locker is nowhere near here, I think you need some punishment." <<he>> says and attacks you.
  <br><br>
	<<link [[Next|School Lockers Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>

:: School Lockers Fight [nobr]
<<if $fightstart is 1>>
<<combatstart>>
<<set $fightstart to 0>>

<<neutral 1>>

<<maninit>>
<<set $enemytrust -= 100>>
<<set $enemyhealthmax -= 100>>
<<set $enemyhealth -= 100>>
<<set $enemyanger += 100>>
<<npcidlegenitals>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
<<He>> runs and collides with you, sending you both tumbling to the ground.
<br><br>
<<else>>
"Oh yeah," you say. "What are you gonna do about it?" <<He>> runs and collides with you, sending you both tumbling to the ground.
<br><br>
<</if>>
<<set $timer to 10>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>><<man>>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if $timer lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|School Lockers Fight Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|School Lockers Fight Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|School Lockers Fight Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|School Lockers Fight]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: School Lockers Fight Finish [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
<<ejaculation>>

The climax seems to have robbed <<him>> of <<his>> remaining anger. "Just don't do it again," <<he>> says, looking sheepish. <<tearful>> you rise to your feet as <<he>> closes <<his>> locker and walks away.
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<set $logprep to "Broke into a locker at school and was found out by the owner of the locker who "+$aw_xedx+" until "+$he+" was satisfied.">>
<<log $logprep 3>>
<<logopinion "That was interesting">>

<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>

"N-no more! You win," <<he>> says tearfully as <<he>> flees the scene. <<tearful>> you stand tall and triumphant.
<<ltrauma>><<lstress>><<gcool>><<trauma -6>><<stress -12>><<status 1>>
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<set $logprep to "Broke into a locker at school and was found out by the owner of the locker so I beat "+$him+" up.">>
<<log $logprep 3>>
<<logopinion "That was interesting">>

<<elseif $timer lte 0>>
<<endevent>>

<<npc Leighton>><<person1>>Leighton storms onto the scene, and physically separates the two of you. "This is completely unacceptable," <<he>> says, looking at you. "I'll see you in my office after school, perhaps I can teach you how to act civil."
<<gdelinquency>><<detention 4 "Fighting">>
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<set $logprep to "Broke into a locker at school and was found out by the owner of the locker so I fought "+$him+" until Leighton came to separate us.">>
<<log $logprep 3>>
<<logopinion "That was interesting">>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<link [[Next|School Lockers]]>><</link>>

:: School Lockers Trap [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

<<if $rng gte 60>>
As you take the money you realise it's covered in some sort of powder and breathing some of that in makes you feel funny.
<<set $hallucinogen += 60>>
<<elseif $rng gte 10>>
As you take the money you suddenly feel pain in your hand and quickly pull it away. You notice that now there's a sharp spike with your blood on it near where the money was.
<<pain 20>>
<<else>>
As you take the money you realise it's covered in some sort of powder and breathing some of that in makes you feel warm.
<<gggarousal>><<arousal 2000>><<set $drugged += 180>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|School Lockers]]>><</link>>

:: School Lockers Life [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

<<if $lockertime is undefined>>
	<<set $lockertime to 0>>
<</if>>

<<if $phase is "noise">>
	<<if !$worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
		You yell and knock around in the locker making as much noise as possible.
		<<if $lockertime lte 5 or $rng gte 90>>
			Soon the locker opens but instead of being let out you're held in place as your mouth is gagged and the door is closed again leaving you trapped and gagged.
			<<facewear 4>>
			<<pass 5>>
			<<link [[Make noise|School Lockers Life]]>><<set $phase to "noise">><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Wait|School Lockers Life]]>><<set $phase to "wait">><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		You make as much noise as you can despite the gag muffling your voice and the tight space preventing your kicks and hits from being strong enough to be very loud.
	<</if>>
<<elseif $phase is "wait">>
<<else>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|School Lockers]]>><</link>>
